(6756086, 1012336, 86447, '<td valign="top">Not sure at all what the title is telling me...but...<br/> <br/>I like this image.  It seems that she is looking back... toward... something.<br/> <br/>The emotion is what gets me here.<br/> <br/> <br/>(I''m guessing by your title, that the scene was different than it appears here.  Yet, you''ve limited my imagination by telling me that she must be going ''round and ''round.   I liked the stories your image invoked in my head, until you told me the real one.   Leave the viewer some imagination.  <br/> <br/>But, I hate titles.  They limit a photo.)<br/> <br/>I REALLY love the blacks and the lights.    Fabulous contrast that I envy.<br/> <br/>(commenting only)</td>', 'Not sure at all what the title is telling me...but... I like this image.  It seems that she is looking back... toward... something. The emotion is what gets me here.  (I''m guessing by your title, that the scene was different than it appears here.  Yet, you''ve limited my imagination by telling me that she must be going ''round and ''round.   I liked the stories your image invoked in my head, until you told me the real one.   Leave the viewer some imagination.   But, I hate titles.  They limit a photo.) I REALLY love the blacks and the lights.    Fabulous contrast that I envy. (commenting only)', '2012-05-01 01:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
