(6756141, 1012681, 86447, '<td valign="top">I love this!<br/> <br/>I think, though, that a bit of processing would have brought the fish''s expression into focus so we could feel more of the story.<br/> <br/>As is, it''s all about the bird.  But, if the fish were more in focus, then we''d have both sides of the story.<br/> <br/>If I''d missed the DOF and couldn''t clearly see the fish, I''d edit it with  sharp dodge and burn brushes.<br/> <br/>Still... a wonderful entry.<br/> <br/>(commenting only)</td>', 'I love this! I think, though, that a bit of processing would have brought the fish''s expression into focus so we could feel more of the story. As is, it''s all about the bird.  But, if the fish were more in focus, then we''d have both sides of the story. If I''d missed the DOF and couldn''t clearly see the fish, I''d edit it with  sharp dodge and burn brushes. Still... a wonderful entry. (commenting only)', '2012-05-01 01:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
