(6759541, 1011126, 138253, '<td valign="top">Fast moving clouds detract from this a bit in my opinion. Love the setup and color, but this feels too energetic for a serene landscape shot.<br/>Then again, others in a more energetic mood may appreciate the blur and feeling of moving as inspiration to get up and go.... so yeah, i''ll stop typing now, it''s still a good shot and worthy of a good score :)</td>', 'Fast moving clouds detract from this a bit in my opinion. Love the setup and color, but this feels too energetic for a serene landscape shot.Then again, others in a more energetic mood may appreciate the blur and feeling of moving as inspiration to get up and go.... so yeah, i''ll stop typing now, it''s still a good shot and worthy of a good score :)', '2012-05-04 10:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6759545, 1012681, 138253, '<td valign="top">This made me laugh when it loaded on the screen. I hadn''t seen the thumbnail for it and i was in the middle of eating some breakfast myself, had to look at my food to see if it was making the same face as the fish.<br/> <br/>Great capture here. Always love seeing good nature photos!<br/> <br/>Also, I''m taking a guess that this is Hahn.</td>', 'This made me laugh when it loaded on the screen. I hadn''t seen the thumbnail for it and i was in the middle of eating some breakfast myself, had to look at my food to see if it was making the same face as the fish. Great capture here. Always love seeing good nature photos! Also, I''m taking a guess that this is Hahn.', '2012-05-04 10:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
