(6761301, 1009129, 138630, '<td valign="top">Looks as if you got good detail but used too strong a noise removal filter.  I would rather see it used selectively or even have a little noise to having this satiny look, but that''s personal preference.</td>', 'Looks as if you got good detail but used too strong a noise removal filter.  I would rather see it used selectively or even have a little noise to having this satiny look, but that''s personal preference.', '2012-05-06 20:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
