(6761314, 1012898, 138630, '<td valign="top">The focus and clarity on the boy - his face and hands - are wonderful.  I don''t understand why you didn''t crop the left and bottom - I think you could have cloned out the bit of knee or elbow that remained in the lower left corner and still met advanced rules.  With an 8x10 vertical, you could have lost it all.</td>', 'The focus and clarity on the boy - his face and hands - are wonderful.  I don''t understand why you didn''t crop the left and bottom - I think you could have cloned out the bit of knee or elbow that remained in the lower left corner and still met advanced rules.  With an 8x10 vertical, you could have lost it all.', '2012-05-06 20:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6761319, 1011173, 138630, '<td valign="top">I find the scene charming, the colors delightful - you can hardly beat a red door LOL  I do wish the shadows were quite a bit lighter in the top so this would feel more balanced.</td>', 'I find the scene charming, the colors delightful - you can hardly beat a red door LOL  I do wish the shadows were quite a bit lighter in the top so this would feel more balanced.', '2012-05-06 20:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
