(6762463, 1013044, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice pose and a great smile makes this a wonderful headshot! The color is a little cool having a blue hue to it showing up especially in the whites of her eyes. Technicals are all good as far as focus exposure, etc. I like the catchlights captured in her eyes and you did a nice job with the nose ring showing no particularly overt glare.</td>', 'Nice pose and a great smile makes this a wonderful headshot! The color is a little cool having a blue hue to it showing up especially in the whites of her eyes. Technicals are all good as far as focus exposure, etc. I like the catchlights captured in her eyes and you did a nice job with the nose ring showing no particularly overt glare.', '2012-05-07 19:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6762474, 1012870, 10785, '<td valign="top">Sweet little candid moment nicely shot and framed. You got great focus and exposure here. I think the color is a bit off as it looks really blue, especially in the whites of the eyes and in her hair. (Perhaps it is light reflected off the blue sweater but possibly the white balance.) This would transpose well to a high key black and white!</td>', 'Sweet little candid moment nicely shot and framed. You got great focus and exposure here. I think the color is a bit off as it looks really blue, especially in the whites of the eyes and in her hair. (Perhaps it is light reflected off the blue sweater but possibly the white balance.) This would transpose well to a high key black and white!', '2012-05-07 20:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6762475, 1008110, 76335, '<td valign="top">Indeed it does. Your John Doe seems to be losing his head. Or maybe it just blends in with its surroundings. The Ultimate Conformist. <br/> <br/>(Do I know the poet?)</td>', 'Indeed it does. Your John Doe seems to be losing his head. Or maybe it just blends in with its surroundings. The Ultimate Conformist.  (Do I know the poet?)', '2012-05-07 20:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
