(6762876, 1012681, 51747, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by RyanWareham:</b></div><hr/><i> This made me laugh when it loaded on the screen. I hadn''t seen the thumbnail for it and i was in the middle of eating some breakfast myself, had to look at my food to see if it was making the same face as the fish.<br/> <br/>Great capture here. Always love seeing good nature photos!<br/> <br/>Also, I''m taking a guess that this is Hahn. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/> Thank you for comparing this image with the work of Richard <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=54446" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">hahn23</a>. I take that as an extreme compliment.</td>', 'Originally posted by RyanWareham: This made me laugh when it loaded on the screen. I hadn''t seen the thumbnail for it and i was in the middle of eating some breakfast myself, had to look at my food to see if it was making the same face as the fish. Great capture here. Always love seeing good nature photos! Also, I''m taking a guess that this is Hahn.    Thank you for comparing this image with the work of Richard  hahn23. I take that as an extreme compliment.', '2012-05-08 01:28:13.000000', NULL, 0),
