(6763297, 1012690, 66384, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your ribbon. Quite an accomplishment in a FS. Your photo is beautiful. <br/> <br/>I do a lot of bird photography myself, and I am curious about the darkness in this image. What time of day was this? I see the very low angle light coming from the right, but there doesn''t seen to be any pink I would expect at sunrise or sunset. If you feel like it, I would love to know more about the circumstances of this shot.</td>', 'Congratulations on your ribbon. Quite an accomplishment in a FS. Your photo is beautiful.  I do a lot of bird photography myself, and I am curious about the darkness in this image. What time of day was this? I see the very low angle light coming from the right, but there doesn''t seen to be any pink I would expect at sunrise or sunset. If you feel like it, I would love to know more about the circumstances of this shot.', '2012-05-08 11:31:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(6763298, 1012947, 117474, '<td valign="top">Gave you an 8... very surprised it didn''t break 5.6...</td>', 'Gave you an 8... very surprised it didn''t break 5.6...', '2012-05-08 11:32:53.000000', NULL, 0),
