(6763582, 1009947, 100393, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by markwiley:</b></div><hr/><i> Captivating stare. Beautifully handled. I hesitate to mention that I might find the fingernail polish a minor distraction. Wonderful shot. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yes - they were metallic; with matching toe nails! Raphaella''s choice.</td>', 'Originally posted by markwiley: Captivating stare. Beautifully handled. I hesitate to mention that I might find the fingernail polish a minor distraction. Wonderful shot.   Yes - they were metallic; with matching toe nails! Raphaella''s choice.', '2012-05-08 16:29:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(6763586, 1009947, 100393, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LydiaToo:</b></div><hr/><i> I wonder what males will have to say about this fabulously lit image.  Ha!<br/> <br/>To me... I love the face with that eye... GORGEOUS... along with the light...and the emotion/tension in the shot.<br/> <br/>Then... my eye gets to her breast and struggles to leave.  To me, it competes with the subject which is her face, right?  So, I think it would be better  covered... even by her hand.<br/> <br/>I''m interested in why you''ve chosen to include it.<br/>Interesting...  I can''t wait to read your other comments.<br/> <br/>It''s so well done technically.    I love all of it except the breast... and I don''t hate it... <br/> <br/>This image definitely stands out (in a good way) in the crowd of FS gallery.<br/> <br/>(commenting only) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I didn''t really think about this and (truly) don''t even notice such things when shooting nudes. She was actually fully nude in the set before and she chose the skirt to <i>add</i> into the shot - rather than having taken her top off.</td>', 'Originally posted by LydiaToo: I wonder what males will have to say about this fabulously lit image.  Ha! To me... I love the face with that eye... GORGEOUS... along with the light...and the emotion/tension in the shot. Then... my eye gets to her breast and struggles to leave.  To me, it competes with the subject which is her face, right?  So, I think it would be better  covered... even by her hand. I''m interested in why you''ve chosen to include it.Interesting...  I can''t wait to read your other comments. It''s so well done technically.    I love all of it except the breast... and I don''t hate it...  This image definitely stands out (in a good way) in the crowd of FS gallery. (commenting only)   I didn''t really think about this and (truly) don''t even notice such things when shooting nudes. She was actually fully nude in the set before and she chose the skirt to add into the shot - rather than having taken her top off.', '2012-05-08 16:31:59.000000', NULL, 0),
