(6763676, 1008605, 12611, '<td valign="top">Nice movement and shadows. Far be it from me to think I know why something does well or not, but, I think I know here. Although there are benefits from the tall perspective, including the sky and the leading lines, it seems a bit distant, and lacks the big punch of a squarer crop.<br/> <br/>FWIW, its one of my favorites from this FS go-around.</td>', 'Nice movement and shadows. Far be it from me to think I know why something does well or not, but, I think I know here. Although there are benefits from the tall perspective, including the sky and the leading lines, it seems a bit distant, and lacks the big punch of a squarer crop. FWIW, its one of my favorites from this FS go-around.', '2012-05-08 18:43:27.000000', NULL, 0),
