(6763884, 1008405, 39057, '<td valign="top">Wow....<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hahn23:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LydiaToo:</b></div><hr/><i> What a fabulous vista!  The sky is wonderful!<br/> <br/>Three is a bit too much greenery for me... to focus on the mountain and that sky... It does frame it beautifully, but ... perhaps a crop?<br/> <br/>(commenting only) </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Just so you know, your comments indicating "without vote" are very irritating.  I wish you would either not comment at all, or just vote your fair and objective opinion. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Wow.... Originally posted by hahn23: Originally posted by LydiaToo: What a fabulous vista!  The sky is wonderful! Three is a bit too much greenery for me... to focus on the mountain and that sky... It does frame it beautifully, but ... perhaps a crop? (commenting only)  Just so you know, your comments indicating "without vote" are very irritating.  I wish you would either not comment at all, or just vote your fair and objective opinion. ', '2012-05-08 23:39:35.000000', NULL, 0),
