(6764034, 1009947, 113900, '<td valign="top">I didn''t even notice the model''s breast the first two times I looked at the photo, and this is coming from a guy who notices breasts lol.   In all honesty the model''s pose and Paul''s lighting is so absolutely perfect that I didn''t even notice it was a nude.  I also am completely enthralled with the  beauty of the model''s face, honestly one of the most beautiful women I''ve ever seen.   <br/> <br/>This is one of my favorite shots I''ve ever seen on this website.  Sorry to keep gushing, I just find this to be so amazing that I can''t stop lookimg at it, and it has nothing to do with it being a nude.</td>', 'I didn''t even notice the model''s breast the first two times I looked at the photo, and this is coming from a guy who notices breasts lol.   In all honesty the model''s pose and Paul''s lighting is so absolutely perfect that I didn''t even notice it was a nude.  I also am completely enthralled with the  beauty of the model''s face, honestly one of the most beautiful women I''ve ever seen.    This is one of my favorite shots I''ve ever seen on this website.  Sorry to keep gushing, I just find this to be so amazing that I can''t stop lookimg at it, and it has nothing to do with it being a nude.', '2012-05-09 01:42:00.000000', NULL, 0),
