(6764693, 1012065, 138253, '<td valign="top">This is the very first photo that i am giving my "deserved a better score" award to.<br/>The community here can sometimes be harsh in their vote casting as many hold everybody to an incredibly high standard. This effect causes many to rise to the occasion but can be daunting at the beginning.<br/>As you are new here and, like many, want to learn and improve your skills, i feel that you are a fitting recipient for this.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1014707" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/138253/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014707.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/138253/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014707.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/138253/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014707.jpg"/></a></td>', 'This is the very first photo that i am giving my "deserved a better score" award to.The community here can sometimes be harsh in their vote casting as many hold everybody to an incredibly high standard. This effect causes many to rise to the occasion but can be daunting at the beginning.As you are new here and, like many, want to learn and improve your skills, i feel that you are a fitting recipient for this.', '2012-05-09 13:27:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(6764699, 1012586, 65319, '<td valign="top">PRICELESS...love this one!  ;-)</td>', 'PRICELESS...love this one!  ;-)', '2012-05-09 13:30:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(6764701, 1010748, 32345, '<td valign="top">Wow! Congrats for the blue!</td>', 'Wow! Congrats for the blue!', '2012-05-09 13:31:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(6764724, 1012065, 142363, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how to take being the recipient of the very first "bird" award - but it gave me such a huge laugh, I''m going to consider it a compliment.<br/> <br/>Thank you to everyone for the comments - they help.  I''m looking forward to better things - like editing a picture (post-processing) for the first time.  Side challenges.  Self-portraits.  Harsh and not-so-harsh critiques as long as they''re honest.  And continuing to be in awe of the varied and diverse talents in this forum.  <br/> <br/></td>', 'I''m not sure how to take being the recipient of the very first "bird" award - but it gave me such a huge laugh, I''m going to consider it a compliment. Thank you to everyone for the comments - they help.  I''m looking forward to better things - like editing a picture (post-processing) for the first time.  Side challenges.  Self-portraits.  Harsh and not-so-harsh critiques as long as they''re honest.  And continuing to be in awe of the varied and diverse talents in this forum.   ', '2012-05-09 13:44:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(6764759, 1012065, 138253, '<td valign="top">Oh, it''s a complement, it''s not meant to be a jab at you, moreso at the voters for voting lower than the photo deserved :)</td>', 'Oh, it''s a complement, it''s not meant to be a jab at you, moreso at the voters for voting lower than the photo deserved :)', '2012-05-09 14:21:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(6764797, 1012608, 19825, '<td valign="top">I only got about 3/4 of the way through voting the Free Study, and I missed this. This is fantastic, Oliver -- a face only a mother can love. It is way under appreciated in voting. You handled the processing very well. <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=137576" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Giles_uk</a> thought it was taken by <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30214" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">LevT</a> or <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=113156" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">jagar</a> -- a major compliment. You are doing well in Chinatown. <br/> <br/>Sorry i did not vote on it. I just noticed, if I would have gotten to this in voting and given it the vote it deserved you probably would have passed that kid who got 95th.</td>', 'I only got about 3/4 of the way through voting the Free Study, and I missed this. This is fantastic, Oliver -- a face only a mother can love. It is way under appreciated in voting. You handled the processing very well.  Giles_uk thought it was taken by  LevT or  jagar -- a major compliment. You are doing well in Chinatown.  Sorry i did not vote on it. I just noticed, if I would have gotten to this in voting and given it the vote it deserved you probably would have passed that kid who got 95th.', '2012-05-09 15:05:13.000000', NULL, 0),
