(6783167, 1009947, 108580, '<td valign="top">Great POV and excellent controlled lighting. I''d do an apprenticeship with you any day to learn (one day isn''t enough) model direction. Her breast is subtle and taught flat due arched back. It''s there and alluring but hardly noticeable. The slight grain; vision of my darkroom days.</td>', 'Great POV and excellent controlled lighting. I''d do an apprenticeship with you any day to learn (one day isn''t enough) model direction. Her breast is subtle and taught flat due arched back. It''s there and alluring but hardly noticeable. The slight grain; vision of my darkroom days.', '2012-06-01 09:08:12.000000', NULL, 0),
